<import src="../../templates/shared.wxml" />
<view class="page">
  <view class="title">帮助与客服</view>
  <template is="status" data="{{error, notice, denied, loading, scopeReady, allowed, busy, guest}}" />
  <block wx:if="{{allowed}}">
    <view class="card"><view class="title">联系客服</view><view class="muted">账号、作品提交和收益查询等使用问题。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{settings.serviceHours}}" class="muted">服务时间：{{settings.serviceHours}}</view>
      <button wx:if="{{settings.miniContactEnabled}}" type="primary" open-type="contact" session-from="support-page" binderror="contactError">微信在线客服</button>
      <view wx:elif="{{settings}}" class="muted">在线客服尚未开通，可先查看下方常见问题。</view>
      <button size="mini" bindtap="load" disabled="{{loading}}">刷新联系方式</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{settings.businessUrl}}" class="card"><view class="title">商务合作</view><view class="muted">渠道、团队和项目合作，请通过飞书联系商务。</view><button bindtap="copyBusiness">复制商务飞书链接</button><view class="muted">复制后在浏览器打开，按提示添加联系人。</view></view>
    <view class="card"><view class="title">常见问题</view><view class="question">登录遇到问题</view><view class="muted">使用已验证的手机号加密码登录，或选择短信验证码。旧账号可以使用原账号登录。</view><view class="question">作品提交失败怎么办</view><view class="muted">在作品记录中查看失败提示，修改后重新提交。提交成功后仍需等待审核结果。</view><view class="question">咨询时提供什么</view><view class="muted">请提供用户 ID、关键词、发生时间和截图。不要发送密码或短信验证码。</view><button wx:if="{{user.userId}}" size="mini" bindtap="copyId">复制我的用户 ID</button></view>
  </block>
</view>
